      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "During rigging fullbody it's important on some avatars to be able to walk infront/behind (viewpoint) and move the waist tracker up/down (knees and height) so the character is rigged properly.\nI believe during uploading an avatar you can disable IPD adjustment.\nIdeally just don't move while changing to a new avatar and make sure you have enough room to rig, else use playspacemover to move yourself to the model.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
