      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a6ffbd6337de65dbe2d92a1|full_name}: without IPD adjustment you need to scale your avatar to match your real world proportions, which isn't always desirable. The other problem here is that even if you don't move when changing avatars, the change to the loading avatar can teleport you off a cliff.",
